\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. In full and glad surrender
\par I give myself to Thee;
\par Thine utterly, and only,
\par And ever more to be.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. O Son of God, who lov'st me,
\par I will be Thine alone;
\par And all I have, and all I am.
\par Shall henceforth be Thine own
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Reign over me, Lord Jesus;
\par O make my heart Thine throne
\par It shall be Thine, my Saviour,
\par It shall be Thine alone.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. O come and reign, Lord Jesus,
\par Rule over everything;
\par And keep me always loyal
\par And true to Thee, my King.
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

